verb sway_timer_clears "Cursed Skulltula person sways from a hit to its front is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2040 430
  take timer_sway
  unless phase_sway

verb sway_armed_timer_clears "Cursed Skulltula person sways from a hit to its front, primed to spin into Link is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2180 500
  take timer_sway_armed
  unless phase_sway_armed

